      "name": "Rejuvenation",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "When Chafkhem is destroyed, necromantic energies rebuild his body in the magic circle in his room over 1d10 days. If the re-forming body is destroyed during that time, the process starts anew. Chafkhem can be destroyed for good with a Consecrate ritual, or if the magic circle is destroyed."
