      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "arcane"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger A creature Chafkhem can see makes a melee Strike against Chafkhem\n\n---\nEffect Chafkhem traces a magical glyph in the air that glows and fades. The triggering creature must attempt a DC 25 Fortitude save save.\n\n---\nSuccess The target is unaffected.\n\nFailure The target is Blinded until the start of its next turn.\n\nCritical Failure The target is blinded for 1 minute."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Mummy Rot",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "curse",
        "disease",
        "divine",
        "void"
      ],
      "text": "This disease and any damage from it can't be healed until this curse is removed. A creature killed by mummy rot turns to dust and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-rank Resurrect ritual or similar magic.\n\nSaving Throw DC 24 Fortitude save\n\n---\n\nStage 1 carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)\n\nStage 2 6d6 void damage and Stupefied 1 (1 day)"
